# ---- data & tokenizers (regenerate with prep_fineweb.py) ----
*.pt
fineweb_*.pt
tinypython_*.pt
fineweb_bpe16k-vocab.json
fineweb_bpe16k-merges.txt
data/
*.bin
*.arrow
*.npy

# ---- training artifacts ----
runs/*.pt
runs/**/*.pt
runs/*.log
checkpoints/
ck_*.pt
*.ckpt

# NOTE: runs/*.jsonl IS tracked on purpose -- it is the measurement record
# behind every claim in sca2/README.md. Drop the '!' lines to untrack.
!runs/*.jsonl

# ---- python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
venv/
.venv/
env/
.python-version

